        "created_at": "2013-08-07T22:37:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, I'm in the middle of writing something 'Sentinels' theme, and I've been wondering a few things about Unity and her golems.</p><p>Firstly, how much 'personality' do they have? Do they have their own base level of sentience and such, or is it really like she's just channeling her personality through them?</p><p>And since we're on the topic, what does everyone think on Omnitron-X's personality? I know that he has one, but how far along the line is he between robots and human?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:02.156Z",
