        "created_at": "2013-08-07T22:45:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd say don't limit yourself by people's opinions on how these characters behave. They are all vague enough for you to bring them to life any way you view them. I, for one, really enjoy it when someone develops a character in a manner I hadn't thought of before.&nbsp;</p>",
