        "created_at": "2013-08-07T22:47:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, based on the flavor text of Swift Bot, the only bot that actually says anything (actually Turret Bot says, \"Budda, Budda, Budda\"), it seems like it is a lot of Unity's personality.</p><p>EDIT: Ninja'd. Anyways, I agree with the above. Go with what feels right with you.</p>",
