      {
        "id": 70198,
        "name": "Ironic",
        "username": "Ironic",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-07T23:13:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For myself, I don't see the bots as having any AI at all - they are drones being operated electrokintcally by Unity. &nbsp;O-X, on the other hand, I portray as being fully a \"person,\" with emotions and all that, because it's a plot point that it's not just an unfeeling machine, and I think most of the robots in fiction who making toeing that line a major hook are boring retreads.</p><p>But if I wanted to share that enough to write a story, I'd write a story. &nbsp;As everyone is saying, do things your way. &nbsp;No apologies, and no looking back!</p><p>Ironic</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:48:59.272Z",
