        "raw": "<p>For myself, I don&#39;t see the bots as having any AI at all - they are drones being operated electrokintcally by Unity. &nbsp;O-X, on the other hand, I portray as being fully a &quot;person,&quot; with emotions and all that, because it&#39;s a plot point that it&#39;s not just an unfeeling machine, and I think most of the robots in fiction who making toeing that line a major hook are boring retreads.</p><p>But if I wanted to share that enough to write a story, I&#39;d write a story. &nbsp;As everyone is saying, do things your way. &nbsp;No apologies, and no looking back!</p><p>Ironic</p>",
