        "id": 70199,
        "name": "Craig",
        "username": "Craig",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-10T19:32:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I imagine O-X as a very Red Tornado/Data sort of character. No emotions, but just on the cusp. Part of his relentless pursuit to become human means attempting them.</p><p>As far as the bots? I imagine them as personality caricatures.</p>",
