      {
        "id": 70200,
        "name": "pyrofrog",
        "username": "pyrofrog",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pyrofrog/{size}/1963_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-10T19:40:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Taking an excerpt from the bio of O-X:</p><blockquote><p>&nbsp;This new, tenth form of Omnitron realized with horror, a new emotion, that its previous purpose had been death and destruction! It focused its new efforts on returning to its point of origin to destroy itself before millions of lives could be threatened!&nbsp;</p></blockquote><p>This seems to mean that O-X at the very least, \"felt\" both horror and from the empathy chip... Well... Empathy. So, he wouldn't be as cold as Tornado or Data (tv show). But I can't picture him showing the emotions as outwardly as Data in the movies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>i agree with the bots being caricatures. (And funny ones at that.)</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
