        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-10T21:57:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I don't see moods being a thing Omnitron-X has.</p><p>His Empathy allows him to care for others at the minimum and to be horrified by the idea of wiping out living things for no reason. &nbsp;I don't imagine we'd see happy or angry or sad Omnitron-X, more of a mister Spock than a data, but you know, lacking a full range of emotion, rahter than supressing it.</p>",
