        "raw": "<p>Yeah, I don&#39;t see moods being a thing Omnitron-X has.</p><p>His Empathy allows him to care for others at the minimum and to be horrified by the idea of wiping out living things for no reason. &nbsp;I don&#39;t imagine we&#39;d see happy or angry or sad Omnitron-X, more of a mister Spock than a data, but you know, lacking a full range of emotion, rahter than supressing it.</p>",
